      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VICTA KREV (5) could manage only second but ran fast time (30.49) at Angle Park over 530m. Has the ability and looks hard to top. ZIPPING ROVE (7) is a fast dog well performed over the sprint races. Filled the minor placings over 455m at this track (25.49) in a Grade 3/4/5 but is better placed at the shorter trip here. Strike rate this course and distance strong having won two of three tries. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Overdue and expected to feature again. EXIT MODE (8) is a well performed dog who recorded his 22nd career win last time out at Angle Park (19.70). Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Will go close again if runs up to latest. IMAGINE THE FUN (4) did a good job to finish third last time out over 342m at Angle Park (20.34) in a Grade 4, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
